<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title><%= content_for(:title) || "Code Blog" %></title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
    <%= csp_meta_tag %>

    <%= yield :head %>

    <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
    <link rel="icon" href="/icon.png" type="image/png">
    <link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icon.png">
    <%= stylesheet_link_tag "application", "data-turbo-track": "reload" %>
    <%= javascript_include_tag "application", "data-turbo-track": "reload", type: "module" %>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-gray-100">
    <header class="bg-white shadow">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <h1 class="text-xl font-bold">Denali</h1>
            <nav>
                <ul class="flex space-x-4">
                    <li><a href="#" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-blue-500">Home</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-blue-500">About</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-blue-500">Contact</a></li>
                        <% if user_signed_in? %>
                            <li><%= link_to "Profile", edit_user_registration_path %></li>
                            <li><%= link_to "New Blog Post", new_article_path %></li>
                            <li><%= button_to "Log Out", destroy_user_session_path, method: :delete %></li>
                        <% else %>
                            <li><%= link_to "Log In", new_user_session_path %></li>
                            <li><%= link_to "Sign Up", new_user_registration_path %></li>
                        <% end %>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="prose-lg container mx-auto px-4 py-8 flex">
        <aside class="w-1/4 bg-white p-4 shadow rounded-lg">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Profile" class="rounded-full mb-4">
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Denali is a simple responsive blog template. Easily add new posts using the Editor or change layout and design using the Designer.</p>
            <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">Featured Posts:</h2>
            <ul class="text-gray-600">
                <li>According a funnily until preset or arrogant well cheerful</li>
                <li>Overlaid the jeepers uselessly much excluding</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="flex space-x-2 mt-4">
                <a href="#" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-blue-500"><i class="fab fa-facebook"></i></a>
                <a href="#" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-blue-500"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
                <a href="#" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-blue-500"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a>
                <a href="#" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-blue-500"><i class="fab fa-linkedin"></i></a>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-4">BUILT WITH WEBFLOW</p>
        </aside>

        <section class="w-3/4 ml-8 space-y-6">
            <article class="bg-white p-4 shadow rounded-lg flex">
                <p class="notice"><%= notice %></p>
                <p class="alert"><%= alert %></p>
                <%= yield %>
            </article>
          
            <article class="bg-white p-4 shadow rounded-lg flex">
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Post Image" class="w-1/3 rounded-lg mr-4">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Coffee sugar, chicory seasonal espresso barista americano</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-2">AUGUST 26, 2024 | MUSIC</p>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">Arista, percolator, cream, aromatic, fair trade, breve body instant lungo blue mountain cappuccino. Americano aroma mug espresso latte crema milk redeye acerbic. Galão robusta instant, decaffeinated, so fair trade wings. <a href="#" class="text-blue-500">Read more...</a></p>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="bg-white p-4 shadow rounded-lg flex">
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Post Image" class="w-1/3 rounded-lg mr-4">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Coffee variety macchiato, as organic ut variety caffeine americano</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-2">AUGUST 26, 2024 | TRAVEL</p>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">Saucer, crema carajillo, bar, mocha medium, latte cappuccino and espresso acerbic to go. Coffee, irish foam turkish coffee blue mountain seasonal. Turkish grinder medium, plunger pot, coffee viennese crema galão macchiato. <a href="#" class="text-blue-500">Read more...</a></p>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="bg-white p-4 shadow rounded-lg flex">
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Post Image" class="w-1/3 rounded-lg mr-4">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg">According a funnily until pre-set or arrogant well cheerful</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-2">AUGUST 26, 2024 | MUSIC</p>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">Single shot cultivar beans as chicory caffeine. Medium brewed, milk extra that froth pumpkin spice mocha. Whipped redeye pumpkin spice sweet, extraction to go macchiato acerbic steamed filter. Robusta grounds decaffeinated. <a href="#" class="text-blue-500">Read more...</a></p>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="bg-white p-4 shadow rounded-lg flex">
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Post Image" class="w-1/3 rounded-lg mr-4">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Wherever far wow thus a squirrel raccoon jeez jaguar this from along</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-2">AUGUST 26, 2024 | ART</p>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">The copy warned the Little Blind Text, that where it came from it would have been rewritten a thousand times and everything that was left from its origin would be the word "and" and the Little Blind <a href="#" class="text-blue-500">Read more...</a></p>
                </div>
            </article>
        </section>
         <%= console if Rails.env.development? %>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
